      "subject_newsroom_count": 30,
      "summary": "Across multiple outlets, reports agree that former President Donald Trump said he will create a new United States 'AI Force' to accelerate and monitor artificial intelligence development and that he plans to appoint an AI 'czar' or tsar to lead or oversee the effort. Coverage indicates the announcement frames the initiative as a US response to AI risks and competition, with Trump saying the new body will both foster and keep watch over the technology."
